# Results are the corrected and per-chromosome BAMs. samtools stamps each one
# with an @PG header line holding its exact command, output path included, so
# BAMs are compared by content through the bam normaliser (SAM text minus @PG).
# The .bai indexes are left out on purpose: they encode byte offsets into the
# compressed BAM, which shift with that header line, so they cannot agree
# between targets even when the alignments do. The BAM comparison covers them.
*.bam
